  "description": "A CLR_ST_GEOG_* operator table for Apache Calcite. Calcite's spatial library is planar JTS answering in the units of an unprojected coordinate system; a store that speaks WGS84 is geodesic and answers in metres. This package gives the second reading a set of operators of its own, so which reading is meant is written down, and evaluates the operations backends push over Google's S2.",
